    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Zaffeld} at (J-8) in {z:Eastern Adoulin}.
* Zone into {z:Marjami Ravine} from {z:Dho Gates} for a cutscene. The quest will then appear in your log.
** The easiest way to do this is to warp to the Frontier Station. Zone in to {z:Dho Gates} to the north, then zone back into {z:Marjami Ravine}.
* You are going to the same place that you finished during good, the bad the clemont.
* Warp from the Frontier Station to Bivouac #2, then head southeast.
** When you come to a small watch tower, enter the tunnel there at J-9/10. Then continue to (I-10).
*** Climb up the vine when you reach the tent/reive.
* Examine the **Seat of Gramk-Droog** at (I-10) for a cutscene.
* Examine it again to spawn **{m:Mligni-Vorgut}**.
** This monster is a {p:Black Mage}, see their page for more information.
* After the battle, examine the seat one last time for a cutscene.
* Return to the city and go to {z:Western Adoulin} to check the **Hospital** at (I-9) (Across from Flapano) for a cutscene.
* Return to {n:Zaffeld} at (J-8) in {z:Eastern Adoulin} for the final cutscene and reward.

=2 Notes
Due to translation errors, in the final scene Ilney is named Cilmad, and an Elvaan man's name changes from Adrastien to Ilney.
Also, if you happen to discard your Barkarole Earring you can speak with Zaffeld again to recover it for 10,000 Bayld.
